  "2026-10-02T20:59:19.300Z","harness:codex","Registry census and actual install: eligible ext-apps 2.0.3 replaces only 2.0.0, retaining core/client 2.0.0 peers and Node >=20 compatibility with the repository >=22.18 floor. Fully inspected the SDK consumer and actual installed official server declarations; usage remains type-only. The other routine latest candidates were released September 28 through October 1 and remain inside the explicit seven-day cooldown; no exclusion is added. Shared exact coverage is owned by pm-r61juc through its verifies edge."
  "2026-10-02T21:00:44.045Z","harness:codex","All four TypeScript projects pass with actual MCP Apps 2.0.3 server declarations. Existing MCP Apps plus unchanged packed continuation regression suites pass with the real globally installed npm package available via NODE_PATH. Full dependency audit reports no known vulnerabilities, actual CodSpeed owned-file admission passes, and the seven-day cooldown contract passes. The complete shared canonical coverage rerun will now validate the frozen source and dependency graph."
  "2026-10-02T21:21:07.788Z","harness:codex","Shared canonical receipt test-local-murgv9bh-hqiwl4 verifies the eligible MCP Apps 2.0.3 dependency graph with 9616 passing tests and exact all-source 100/100/100/100. The primary security owner links this refresh through verifies; its report receipt test-local-murgvxx1-115b0n records actual integer counts and the generated-report identity. Current tracker context and graph-composition assurance pass after adding this item description and the dependency-census coordination edge, with every threshold unchanged."
